      "Title": "Exam 3V0-21.25 topic 1 question 1 discussion - ExamTopics",
      "Question": {
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "A customer created a workflow to execute during machine provisioning in a VM Apps organization within VMware Cloud Foundation (VCF) Automation 9. The workflow includes inputs that interact with the provisioning-payload data. When a machine is requested, provisioning completes successfully, but the workflow does not run."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "What is the cause of the workflow-execution failure?"
          }
        ]
      },
      "Choices": {
        "A": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "A. The workflow is signed."
            }
          ]
        },
        "B": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "B. The Event Broker Subscription is set to blocking."
            }
          ]
        },
        "C": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "C. The Event Broker Subscription is set to non-blocking."
            }
          ]
        },
        "D": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "D. The workflow is not signed."
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "Answer": {
        "content": []
      },
      "Explanation": {
        "content": []
      },
      "Vote_count": [
        {
          "voted_answers": "C",
